    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "They work when the import is coming from the TypeScript file itself (`src/widgets/infinite-hits/infinite-hits.ts`). That means that you can read them from the test files and from the stories if using the direct file (not `instantsearch.widgets.infiniteHits`).\r\n\r\nIt doesn't work when loaded from other files because we don't export the types yet.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n  <summary>From a test</summary>\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6137112/63173166-8cd8c580-c03f-11e9-89d7-04200b9f05bd.png)\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n  <summary>From a story (import modified locally)</summary>\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6137112/63172908-07edac00-c03f-11e9-89a0-e68244655fc1.png)\r\n\r\n</details>",
